The android.*, androidx.* and dalvik.* classes under host/src/main/java
re-implement public Android framework APIs (Android Open Source Project,
Apache License, Version 2.0) for a plain JVM. The stripped android.jar stub
library built by host/build.gradle.kts is derived from the Android SDK.

The approach of running extensions on a desktop JVM follows Suwayomi-Server
(https://github.com/Suwayomi/Suwayomi-Server, MPL-2.0); no Suwayomi code is
included.
